  "description": "One mesh with authored (+X,+1) tangents is instanced normally and through T(3,0,0)*S(-1,1,1). The shared vertex buffer must stay local, while the mirrored draw transforms T to -X and multiplies w by sign(det(world))=-1 so the reconstructed world bitangent remains +Y. A tangent-space +Y normal map makes that per-draw determinant correction visible.",
